Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Topology Inventory Assembly Source

Description: Raw selected build source for one zero-effect assembly that consumes the three completed output-only supplied topology carrier families, preserves their full lineage, and forms one bounded, duplicate-free, parent-closed, deterministically ordered supplied member set without claiming physical enumeration, completeness, traversal, aggregate digest, receipt, or admission.

