& [VerificationIntent] is comprehensive and effect free
  + strict plan decode, byte cap, profile, identity, limit, and unknown-field tests
  + root-only valid set
  + mixed valid set with nested parents and cross-kind raw UTF-8 ordering
  + each duplicate class tested independently
  + volume mismatch, wrong kind, invalid current M2A form, each limit, missing parent, non-directory parent, and ordinal mismatch tested
  + checked arithmetic and bounded diagnostic tests
  + static test for exact carrier signatures, current validation, private output, no raw observation input, no digest or receipt, and forbidden imports
  + debug and overflow-checked release focused tests
  + workspace debug and overflow-checked release
