  + retain this source, later SJS, solution, proof, review, narrative, and operational fault history
  + no state migration, persisted value, filesystem fixture, or effect cleanup exists

& [DownstreamBoundary] remains separate
  + canonical inventory byte encoding and aggregate digest require their own preserved source and SJS after this ordered set is stable
  + a physical producer must preserve actual runtime, handle, enumeration, traversal, and completeness provenance under separate authority
  + Git reconciliation, double-inventory comparison, receipt issuance, receipt consumption, admission, mutation, sealing, cleanup, and promotion remain distinct later boundaries

& [SourceExit] is preservation before interpretation
